00:03:52.734 --> 00:03:54.667
It's like when "The Brady Bunch"
had a serious --

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.868
♪ Womp, womp, wa-na ♪

00:03:57.868 --> 00:04:00.968
No, it's corn cones, man.

00:04:02.067 --> 00:04:04.767
I'm thumbs-upping it
right now, man. Corn cones.

00:04:04.767 --> 00:04:07.067
I want to see that happen.
Kellogg's, you hearing me?

00:04:07.067 --> 00:04:08.534
Let's see the results.

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:10.067
Oh, my...
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.067 --> 00:04:11.968
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:15.868
Oh, my God.
[ Laughs ]

00:04:15.868 --> 00:04:18.734
Oh, my -- Oh, my gosh.

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:20.367
I've never seen
that result ever.

00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:22.601
-Yeah.
-And I voted "yes" for you.

00:04:22.601 --> 00:04:24.767
-Our audiences are
on the same page tonight.

00:04:24.767 --> 00:04:26.734
