doubled or tripled down on it.

00:04:26.734 --> 00:04:29.067
-No, it doesn't matter.
You can only vote once.

00:04:29.067 --> 00:04:31.133
Alright, the last one here
for "WeTweet."

00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:32.167
